  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759750,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## Wizardry: Proving Grounds of the Mad Overlord (Commodore 64 - 15 Seconds Copy 256K Ram Version)\n\nDescend into the depths of Trebor's castle in *Wizardry: Proving Grounds of the Mad Overlord*, the groundbreaking first installment of the legendary RPG series. This Commodore 64 version, optimized for 256K RAM, brings the classic dungeon crawl experience to your home computer.\n\nCreate a party of up to six adventurers, choosing from diverse races like Humans, Elves, and Dwarves, and mastering classes from Fighter to Ninja. Explore a sprawling, ten-level dungeon maze, meticulously mapping your progress on graph paper (not included) as you battle fearsome monsters and uncover powerful treasures. \n\nPrepare for a challenging adventure – death is permanent, and a total party wipe means losing everything!  The game’s unforgiving difficulty is balanced by its innovative features, including character alignment restrictions and a unique party-based system.  Successfully defeat the evil arch-wizard Werdna and claim the powerful amulet to complete your quest.  A true pioneer of the RPG genre, *Wizardry* set the standard for countless games to follow."
    },
